### PINN corner demo: 7th-order ZK-hierarchy member, 4 variables (x,y,z,t)
###   u_t + nu u u_x + b3 dxLap u + d3 dxLap^2 u + g3 dxLap^3 u = 0
### amplitude-normalised line soliton (k=0.15, g1=1, (l,m,n)=(1,1/2,1/3)):
###   u = sech^6( 0.15(x+y/2+z/3) - 0.15*2.6244 t ),  residual = 0 (verified 1e-43)
### coefficients: nu=A=665280 k^6, b3=12304k^4/L, d3=-200k^2/L^2, g3=1/L^3, L=49/36
Output_deriv 1 /
Init_w       LeCun_unif
Rand_seed    20260806 / fixed seed (reproducibility)
Restart      0 /
Nlayer       4 / L
4 / ndim(1): (x,y,z,t)
8 /
8 /
1 / ndim(L)
###
Loss_term  DATA         180  data.dat           1.d0 /
Loss_term  COLLOCATION     150  colloc.dat         1.d-6 /
###
Residual 5 /
LIN   1.d0             0 0 0 1 /  u_t
UUX   7.577955d0       1 0 0 0 /  nu * u u_x   (nu = A, amplitude-normalised)
DXLAP 4.576334693878d0   1 /       b3 * d_x Lap u      (expands to 3 terms)
DXLAP -2.428987921699d0  2 /       d3 * d_x Lap^2 u    (expands to 6 terms)
DXLAP 0.396569456604d0   3 /       g3 * d_x Lap^3 u    (expands to 10 terms)
Exact_solution 1 /
Hod_check 1 /
###
Num_validation 30 /
Validation_cyc 100 /
P_max          100000 /
###
Epoch      20000 /
Activation TANH /
Conv       1.d-12 /
Num_batch  10 /
Checkpoint_cyc         500 /
GD_method  Adam
GD_param   0.001d0 0.9d0 0.999d0 1.d-8 0.d0 /
